WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:03.870
Now rewards are what users get for
performing actions.

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:08.070
It could be likes on a post, or
maybe some extra coins in a game for

00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:09.500
doing something.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:11.720
The most important question
here is whether or

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:14.270
not your reward leaves
the user wanting more.

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:19.440
So how are your rewards
making users want more?

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:21.600
Use this box to record your thoughts.

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:24.470
And if the answer is they
don't actually want more,

00:00:24.470 --> 00:00:26.290
you might want to rethink your rewards.

